{"synopsis":"Aden Albireo dijuluki Dragon Slayer pahlawan yang membunuh Berserker dan Raja Iblis\nYang pada akhirnya menyelamatkan dunia\nTapi dia dikhianati oleh orangorang yang dekatnya\nAku tidak pernah berpikir akan hidup kembali\n15 tahun sebelum kebangkitan Raja Iblis\nPutra sulung Duke yang ceroboh yang tidak pernah terdengar dan tidak terlihat\nAden Albireo telah kembali dalam tubuh Aden Remes\nTerlebih lagi\nLama tidak bertemu Dragon King\nRaja Iblis yang kupikir telah kubunuh ada di dalam jiwaku","alternative_title":"영웅, 공작가 장남 되다","author":"Geulimjassi, Namukkun","artist":"Jjumsaeng","chapters":[{"number":"65","chapter":"65","slug":"182ea1c1-2181-42aa-8268-3825bdef5ec3","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2025-03-30"},{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"bef17dd5-8a62-475c-a7ec-b5d364c38baf","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2025-03-21"},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"c764d73f-4a78-4c34-b5c4-d00c89851ca9","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2025-03-21"},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"31d68c26-95f5-4ea6-80ef-bb382c5cf2c1","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2025-03-21"},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"be31c1d5-b31e-499d-a40c-770eb3e5b6c5","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2025-03-21"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"45f155aa-0729-4e67-889b-bdef4a774222","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2025-02-26"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"cea4b1ea-85a4-4f19-a0e7-b1ba3d470ad6","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2025-02-26"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"236ccb64-d99f-4de9-83ce-fba9ad87bbe9","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2025-02-26"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"04aecd27-521f-45bb-88c7-e108ef55ecc0","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2025-02-26"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"1bcd0949-a4e7-49ef-b1ca-5e96811ca47b","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2025-01-29"},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"aa4bd90a-fde5-4ff2-b44d-87b4523cb2cb","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2025-01-29"},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"6e04629e-871d-4949-8e76-325031c5bded","title":"Cha